{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "62385af8-063e-8ccc-980a-0cf3534bd7eb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:20:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. Um, my trash bin got damaged by the truck this morning, I think. Or, well, maybe yesterday. Hmm, no, this morning. The lid's cracked right off the hinge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. So the bin was damaged during pickup, and it's the lid that's broken. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the lid and also one side is sort of caved in. Let me see. It was out at the curb with the snow, and then the rain, so it was kind of surrounded by slush, but it was where it's supposed to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Pickups were a little behind after last weekend's storm, so the crews have been running around. What's the address where the bin is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 72 Kingston Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "72 Kingston Avenue. Got it. And is this the trash bin or the recycling bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Trash. The, hmm, the big one. Wait, actually, I should check, it's the green one? No, sorry, it's the gray one with the lid. Yes, gray."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gray trash bin with a cracked lid and a dented side. No problem. I can put in a replacement request for you right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. So that's all I do? I wasn't sure if I had to fill out something or, um, bring it somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you don't need to bring it anywhere. Just leave the damaged one at the curb on your next collection day, and the replacement gets delivered. It can take a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, one second, I'm in the middle of something. I'm learning calligraphy and the ink is still wet, so I'm trying not to smear it with the phone cord."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:20:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, don't smudge it on my account. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm good. Hmm, so should I leave the lid with it, or, no, the whole thing, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:20:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole thing, lid and all. Do you want me to put your callback number on the request in case the driver has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:20:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195. And that's 72 Kingston Avenue, gray trash bin, damaged by the truck. All set, it's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:20:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thank you. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:20:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
